Z||000003||Cheever3000||10-05-2001||09:54 AM||||Lots of good parts to that story.  Here's my favorites:<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>enjoying mutual mid-engine-coolness.<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><I>Very</I>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> !<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>We come to the inevetable (and obligatory in any car story) red light.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Oh, of course!<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>checking the girl out, he is too easially and too throughly distracted<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>There's no girl-watching in racing!<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>honourable sportsman that he is, he backs off<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>That's the type you don't mind losing to.<P>||||reg||1
