Z||000008||California Kid||10-05-2001||05:47 PM||||Hey Ben....Thanks for sharing your story with us.  It brought back memories of when I drove my GT back from CA. Did some high speed "cruisin" with a Viper GTS, guy headed east as well. While we didn't push it over 165, we had some intense fun in the twisties before the road straightened out to "never, never land". We even pulled off for a bite to eat and coffee after we got through admiring each other's car.  He was really impressed with the way my car accelerated and handled. Sure got lonesome after he connected to another interstate.<P><BR>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_7.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 10-05-2001).]||||reg||14
