Z||000011||artherd||10-06-2001||03:57 AM||||Hey guys, glad you enjoyed the story (and got to relive some of your own!)   Thanks for the kind words.<P>PS: Tina, hrm, er, I was going for car parts?  Honest?  heh.<BR>I'm hoping to meet him again when the Northstar's in, though the night wasn't about speed or competition.   Just pure clean mid-engine comradarie!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
